ንዴት ልረዳዎት እችላለሁ?","aria-label":"ለClaude ፕሮምፕትዎን ይጻፉ","loading":"በመጫን ላይ...","reply":"ይመልሱ"},"ar":{"greeting":"أهلًا بك!","placeholder":"كيف يمكنني مساعدتك اليوم؟","aria-label":"اكتب مطالبتك إلى Claude","loading":"جارٍ التحميل...","reply":"رد"},"be":{"greeting":"Вось і вы!","placeholder":"Чым я магу дапамагчы вам сёння?","aria-label":"Напішыце запыт для Claude","loading":"Загрузка…","reply":"Адказаць"},"bho":{"greeting":"आईं, राउर स्वागत बा!","placeholder":"आज हम रउआ के कइसे मदद कर सकीले?","aria-label":"Claude खातिर आपन प्रॉम्प्ट लिखीं","loading":"लोड हो रहल बा...","reply":"जवाब दीं"},"bn":{"greeting":"আপনাকে স্বাগতম!","placeholder":"আজ আমি আপনাকে কীভাবে সাহায্য করতে পারি?","aria-label":"Claude-এর জন্য আপনার প্রম্পট লিখুন","loading":"লোড হচ্ছে…","reply":"উত্তর দিন"},"da":{"greeting":"Dejligt at se dig!","placeholder":"Hvordan kan jeg hjælpe dig i dag?","aria-label":"Skriv din prompt til Claude","loading":"Indlæser…","reply":"Svar"},"fi":{"greeting":"Mukava nähdä!","placeholder":"Miten voin auttaa sinua tänään?","aria-label":"Kirjoita kehotteesi Claudelle","loading":"Ladataan…","reply":"Vastaa"},"fil":{"greeting":"Nandito ka na!","placeholder":"Paano kita matutulungan ngayon?","aria-label":"Isulat ang iyong prompt sa Claude","loading":"Naglo-load...","reply":"Sumagot"},"gu":{"greeting":"તમારું સ્વાગત છે!","placeholder":"આજે હું તમને કેવી રીતે મદદ કરી શકું?","aria-label":"Claude માટે તમારો પ્રોમ્પ્ટ લખો","loading":"લોડ થઈ રહ્યું...","reply":"જવાબ આપો"},"ha":{"greeting":"Barka da zuwa!","placeholder":"Ta yaya zan iya taimaka maka a yau?","aria-label":"Rubuta saƙonka zuwa ga Claude","loading":"Ana lodawa…","reply":"Amsa"},"he":{"greeting":"טוב שבאת!","placeholder":"איך אוכל לעזור לך היום?","aria-label":"כתיבת הפרומפט שלך ל-Claude","loading":"טוען...","reply":"תשובה"},"ig":{"greeting":"Nnọọ!","placeholder":"Kedu ka m ga-esi nyere gị aka taa?","aria-label":"Dee ozi gị nye Claude","loading":"Na-ebute…","reply":"Zaa"},"kn":{"greeting":"ಬನ್ನಿ, ಸ್ವಾಗತ!","placeholder":"ಇಂದು ನಿಮ