<p dir="ltr">This makes a folder <code dir="ltr">olist/</code> (your dbt project). Delete the sample <code dir="ltr">models/example</code> folder inside it.</p>
<ol dir="ltr" start="4">
<li>Create <code dir="ltr">olist/profiles.yml</code>. dbt checks the project folder first, so you don’t need a <code dir="ltr">~/.dbt</code> file:</li>
</ol>
