</span><span><span style="color: rgb(244, 123, 133);">      threads</span><span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">:</span><span style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);"> 4</span></span></span></span></code></pre></div></div></div>
<ol dir="ltr" start="5">
<li>Open <code dir="ltr">olist/dbt_project.yml</code>. Make sure <code dir="ltr">profile: 'olist'</code> matches the name above, and replace the <code dir="ltr">models:</code> section with:</li>
</ol>
