, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono);"><code style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono); white-space: pre-wrap;">.venv/
data/
*.duckdb
olist/target/
olist/dbt_packages/
olist/logs/</code></pre></div></div></div>
<ol dir="ltr" start="7">
<li>Test: <code dir="ltr">cd olist &amp;&amp; dbt debug</code>. You want “All checks passed”. The most common failure is “profile not found,” which usually means the profile name in <code dir="ltr">dbt_project.yml</code> doesn’t match the one in <code dir="ltr">profiles.yml</code>. <span data-not-prose=""><span class="inline-flex" id="base-ui-_r_32f_"><a href="https://levelup.gitconnected.com/setting-up-dbt-with-duckdb-from-zero-to-your-first-dbt-model-dbt-series-2-6037394a8a27" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group/tag relative h-[18px] rounded-full inline-flex items-center overflow-hidden -translate-y-px cursor-pointer"><span class="relative transition-colors h-full max-w-[180px] overflow-hidden px-1.5 inline-flex items-center text-caption-regular font-sans rounded-full border-0.5 border-border-300 bg-bg-200 group-hover/tag:bg-accent-900 group-hover/tag:border-accent-100/60 stacks:group-hover/tag:bg-page stacks:group-hover/tag:layers-1-accent stacks:group-hover/tag:border-transparent"><span dir="auto" class="text-nowrap text-text-300 font-normal group-hover/tag:text-text-200 break-all truncate">gitconnected</span></span><span class="transition-opacity opacity-[0%] group-hover/tag:opacity-[100%] h-[17px] absolute right-[0.5px] rounded-r-full flex items-center px-1.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-accent-900/0 via-accent-900/100 via-30% to-accent-900/100 [&amp;:where(:root[dir=rtl]_:dir(rtl))]:right-auto [&amp;:where(:root[dir=rtl]_:dir(rtl))]:left-[0.5px] [&amp;:where(:root[dir=rtl]_:dir(rtl))]:rounded-r-none [&amp;:where(:root[dir=rtl]_:dir(rtl))]:rounded-l-full [&amp;:where(:root[dir=rtl]_:dir(rtl))]:bg-gradient-to-l stacks:bg-page stacks:layers-1-accent stacks:[mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,transparent,black_30%)] stacks:[&amp;:where(:root[dir=rtl]_:dir(rtl))]:layers-1-accent stacks:[&amp;:where(:root[dir=rtl]_:dir(rtl))]:[mask-image:linear-gradient(to_left,transparent,black_30%)]"><span data-cds="Icon" data-cds-mirror="" class="transition-[opacity,scale,transform] group-hover/tag:ease-out duration-[500ms] ease-in text-accent-100 group-hover/tag:scale-[100%] scale-[80%] group-hover/tag:opacity-[100%] opacity-[0%]" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1)); font-weight: 533.3;"></span></span></a></span></span></li>
</ol>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>Done when:</strong> <code dir="ltr">dbt debug</code> passes.</p>
<h3 dir="ltr" aria-level="5">Phase 1: Get and load the data (45 min)</h3>
<ol dir="ltr">
<li>On Kaggle, search “Brazilian E-Commerce Public Dataset by Olist” (needs a free login). Download and unzip into a <code dir="ltr">data/</code> folder at the repo root. You should have 9 CSVs: customers, geolocation, order_items, order_payments, order_reviews, orders, products, sellers, and <code dir="ltr">product_category_name_translation.csv</code>.</li>
<li>Create <code dir="ltr">load_raw.py</code> at the repo root:</li>
</ol>
<div data-not-prose=""><div role="group" aria-label="python code" tabindex="0" dir="ltr" class="relative group/copy bg-bg-000/50 border-0.5 border-border-400 rounded-[var(--msg-block-radius,0.5rem)] focus-visible:outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent-100"><div class="static opacity-0 transition-[position] transition-discrete duration-0 delay-300 group-hover/copy:sticky group-hover/copy:opacity-100 group-hover/copy:delay-0 group-focus-within/copy:sticky group-focus-within/copy:opacity-100 group-focus-within/copy:delay-0 pointer-coarse:sticky pointer-coarse:opacity-100 [@media(hover:none)]:sticky [@media(max-resolution:1.99dppx)]:sticky [@media(hover:none)]:opacity-100 top-2 py-2 h-12 w-0 float-right"><div class="absolute right-0 h-8 px-2 items-center inline-flex z-10"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 rounded-[calc(var(--cds-radius)+var(--cds-button-radius-add,0px))] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-text-button-icon-disabled)] group-hover/copy:backdrop-blur-md group-focus-within/copy:backdrop-blur-md