<p dir="ltr">Run <code dir="ltr">dbt deps</code> inside <code dir="ltr">olist/</code>.</p>
<ol dir="ltr" start="2">
<li>Create <code dir="ltr">olist/models/staging/_sources.yml</code>:</li>
</ol>
