<p dir="ltr">Add a <code dir="ltr">description:</code> to every column you can. These feed the docs site.</p>
<ol dir="ltr" start="2">
<li>Custom tests (each returns the <em>bad</em> rows; zero rows means pass), in <code dir="ltr">olist/tests/</code>:</li>
</ol>
