ata-perf-reply-text="" class="_blocks_ta2es_47 standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 whitespace-normal break-words print:block"><h2 dir="ltr" aria-level="4">Create the GitHub repo and clone it</h2>
<h3 dir="ltr" aria-level="5">Step 0: Check that Git is installed</h3>
<p dir="ltr">Open a terminal (Mac: Terminal; Windows: PowerShell or Git Bash) and run:</p>
