<p dir="ltr">Type <code dir="ltr">Y</code> if it asks you to confirm. This only affects your user account.</p>
<h3 dir="ltr" aria-level="4">Alternatives</h3>
<ul dir="ltr">
<li><strong>Command Prompt (cmd):</strong> <code dir="ltr">.venv\Scripts\activate.bat</code></li>
<li><strong>Git Bash:</strong> <code dir="ltr">source .venv/Scripts/activate</code> (note <code dir="ltr">Scripts</code>, not <code dir="ltr">bin</code>)</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="ltr" aria-level="4">Windows notes for the rest of the project</h3>
<ul dir="ltr">
<li>Use <code dir="ltr">python</code> rather than <code dir="ltr">python3</code>.</li>
<li>Use <code dir="ltr">dir</code> instead of <code dir="ltr">ls</code> in PowerShell (<code dir="ltr">ls</code> also works in newer versions).</li>
<li>The other commands (<code dir="ltr">pip install ...</code>, <code dir="ltr">dbt init ...</code>, <code dir="ltr">dbt debug</code>) are the same.</li>
</ul>
