hitespace-normal break-words print:block"><p dir="ltr">I can’t see the error, so I’ll list the most likely causes for <code dir="ltr">dbt build --select staging</code>. Paste the exact output and I can pinpoint it.</p>
<h3 dir="ltr" aria-level="4">Most likely causes (check in this order)</h3>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>1. You’re in the wrong folder.</strong> Run the command from inside the dbt project, not the repo root:</p>
