<p dir="ltr">Symptom: “Runtime Error: No dbt_project.yml found”.</p>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>2. Packages not installed.</strong> If the error mentions <code dir="ltr">dbt_utils</code> or <code dir="ltr">dbt_expectations</code> is undefined, or “dbt found 2 package(s) specified... but only 0 installed”:</p>
