5rem)] !text-[length:var(--msg-code-block-size,0.875rem)] !leading-relaxed p-3.5" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono);"><code class="language-powershell" data-highlight="final" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono); white-space: pre;"><span class="block [unicode-bidi:inherit] [text-align:-webkit-match-parent] [text-align:match-parent]" data-code-line-group=""><span><span>dbt deps</span></span></span></code></pre></div></div></div>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>3. Source table not found.</strong> Symptom: <code dir="ltr">Catalog Error: Table with name orders does not exist</code> or “schema raw does not exist”. Either <code dir="ltr">load_raw.py</code> didn’t run, or it created the database in a different place. Check that <code dir="ltr">olist/olist.duckdb</code> exists, and rerun <code dir="ltr">python load_raw.py</code> from the repo root. Table names must match exactly (for example <code dir="ltr">order_items</code>, <code dir="ltr">order_payments</code>, <code dir="ltr">product_category_name_translation</code>).</p>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>4. File lock.</strong> Symptom: <code dir="ltr">Could not set lock on file ... olist.duckdb</code>. Close anything else using the database (DuckDB CLI or UI, a Python session, Streamlit), then rerun.</p>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>5. Column name mismatch.</strong> Symptom: <code dir="ltr">Binder Error: Referenced column "..." not found</code>. Your CSV columns differ slightly from my list. Look at the real column names:</p>
<div data-not-prose=""><div role="group" aria-label="powershell code" tabindex="0" dir="ltr" class="relative group/copy bg-bg-000/50 border-0.5 border-border-400 rounded-[var(--msg-block-radius,0.5rem)] focus-visible:outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent-100"><div class="static opacity-0 transition-[position] transition-discrete duration-0 delay-300 group-hover/copy:sticky group-hover/copy:opacity-100 group-hover/copy:delay-0 group-focus-within/copy:sticky group-focus-within/copy:opacity-100 group-focus-within/copy:delay-0 pointer-coarse:sticky pointer-coarse:opacity-100 [@media(hover:none)]:sticky [@media(max-resolution:1.99dppx)]:sticky [@media(hover:none)]:opacity-100 top-2 py-2 h-12 w-0 float-right"><div class="absolute right-0 h-8 px-2 items-center inline-flex z-10"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 rounded-[calc(var(--cds-radius)+var(--cds-button-radius-add,0px))] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-text-button-icon-disabled)] group-hover/copy:backdrop-blur-md group-focus-within/copy:backdrop-blu