<p dir="ltr">Make sure <code dir="ltr">dbt deps</code> has run (the models use <code dir="ltr">dbt_utils</code>), and that the staging models from Phase 2 exist.</p>
<h3 dir="ltr" aria-level="5">1. <code dir="ltr">olist/models/intermediate/int_order_items_enriched.sql</code></h3>
<p dir="ltr">Grain: one row per order item.</p>
<div data-not-prose=""><div role="group" aria-label="sql code" tabindex="0" dir="ltr" class="relative group/copy bg-bg-000/50 border-0.5 border-border-400 rounded-[var(--msg-block-radius,0.5rem)] focus-visible:outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent-100"><div class="static opacity-0 transition-[position] transition-discrete duration-0 delay-300 group-hover/copy:sticky group-hover/copy:opacity-100 group-hover/copy:delay-0 group-focus-within/copy:sticky group-focus-within/copy:opacity-100 group-focus-within/copy:delay-0 pointer-coarse:sticky pointer-coarse:opacity-100 [@media(hover:none)]:sticky [@media(max-resolution:1.99dppx)]:sticky [@media(hover:none)]:opacity-100 top-2 py-2 h-12 w-0 float-right"><div class="absolute right-0 h-8 px-2 items-center inline-flex z-10"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 rounded-[calc(var(--cds-radius)+var(--cds-button-radius-add,0px))] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-text-button-icon-disabled)] group-hover/copy:backdrop-blur-md group-focus-within/copy:backdrop-blur-md pointer-coarse:backdrop-blur-md [@media(hover:none)]:backdrop-blur-md" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" data-testid="code-block-copy" id="_r_30h_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow] stacks:transition-[box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer  "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1)); font-weight: 433.3;"></span></span></button><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span></div></div><div class="text-secondary text-caption-regular font-sans p-3.5 pb-0 print:break-after-avoid" data-find-omitted="">sql</div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><pre class="code-block__code !my-0 !rounded-[var(--msg-block-radius,0.5rem)] !text-[length:var(--msg-code-block-size,0.875rem)] !leading-relaxed p-3.5" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono);"><code class="language-sql" data-highlight="final" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono); white-space: pre;"><span class="block [unicode-bidi:inherit] [text-align:-webkit-match-parent] [text-align:match-parent]" data-code-line-group=""><span><span><span style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">select</span>
</span><span>    i.order_id,
</span><span>    i.order_item_id,
</span><span>    i.product_id,
</span><span>    i.seller_id,
</span><span>    i.shipping_limit_at,
</span><span>    i.price,
</span><span>    i.freight_value,
</span><span>    o.purchased_at,
</span><span>    o.order_status,
</span><span><span style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">    coalesce</span>(
</span><span>        t.product_category_name_english,
</span><span>        p.product_category_name,
</span><span><span style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">        'unknown'</span>
</span><span>    ) <span style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">as</span> category_name
</span><span><span style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">from</span> {{ ref(<span style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">'stg_order_items'</span>) }} i
</span><span><span style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">left join</span> {{ ref(<span style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">'stg_products'</span>) }} p
</span><span><span style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">    on</span> i.product_id = p.product_id
</span><span><span style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">left join</span> {{ ref(<span style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">'stg_category_translation'</span>) }} t
</span><span><span style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">    on</span> p.product_category_name = t.product_category_name
</span><span><span style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">left join</span> {{ ref(<span style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">'stg_orders'</span>) }} o
</span><span><span style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">    on</span> i.order_id = o.order_id</span></span></span></code></pre></div></div></div>
<p dir="ltr">The <code dir="ltr">coalesce</code> prefers the English category name, falls back to the Portuguese one, then to <code dir="ltr">'unknown'</code>, so no row ends up with a null category.</p>
