r-md pointer-coarse:backdrop-blur-md [@media(hover:none)]:backdrop-blur-md" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" data-testid="code-block-copy" id="_r_30m_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow] stacks:transition-[box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer  "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1)); font-weight: 433.3;"></span></span></button><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span></div></div><div class="text-secondary text-caption-regular font-sans p-3.5 pb-0 print:break-after-avoid" data-find-omitted="">powershell</div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><pre class="code-block__code !my-0 !rounded-[var(--msg-block-radius,0.5rem)] !text-[length:var(--msg-code-block-size,0.875rem)] !leading-relaxed p-3.5" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono);"><code class="language-powershell" data-highlight="final" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono); white-space: pre;"><span class="block [unicode-bidi:inherit] [text-align:-webkit-match-parent] [text-align:match-parent]" data-code-line-group=""><span><span>python -c <span style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">"import duckdb; con=duckdb.connect('olist.duckdb'); print(con.execute('select count(*) from main.fct_order_items').fetchone())"</span></span></span></span></code></pre></div></div></div>
<p dir="ltr">You should see about 112,650 rows, the same as the raw <code dir="ltr">order_items</code> count. If the count is higher, a join is duplicating rows. Check that <code dir="ltr">stg_products</code> and <code dir="ltr">stg_category_translation</code> have unique keys. If dbt created the tables in a schema other than <code dir="ltr">main</code>, run <code dir="ltr">show all tables</code> in DuckDB to find them.</p>
<h3 dir="ltr" aria-level="5">Common errors</h3>
<ul dir="ltr">
<li><strong><code dir="ltr">Binder Error: Referenced column ... not found</code>:</strong> a column name in your staging model differs from what I used (for example <code dir="ltr">purchased_at</code> or <code dir="ltr">seller_zip_code_prefix</code>). Open the staging model and match the names.</li>
<li><strong><code dir="ltr">Compilation Error ... generate_surrogate_key</code>:</strong> run <code dir="ltr">dbt deps</code> first.</li>
<li><strong><code dir="ltr">Table ... does not exist</code> for a <code dir="ltr">ref</code>:</strong> the upstream model hasn’t been built. Run <code dir="ltr">dbt run --select +fct_order_items</code> to build it and everything it depends on.</li>
</ul></div></div></div></div><div class="ms-[calc(var(--cds-assistant-message-text-inset,0px)_-_6px)] touch:has-[&gt;[data-size=xs]&gt;:first-child:not(time)]:ms-[calc(var(--cds-assistant-message-text-inset,0px)_-_0.625rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] print:mt-xs"><div data-testid="message-actions" data-cds="MessageActions" data-deferred="" data-size="xs" class="flex items-center select-none"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-control w-px"></span><button type="button" class="sr-only" aria-label="Show message actions for Claude responded: Code for the four models"></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rs-index="22" data-index="22" data-testid="transcript-row" class="relative [@media(resolution:1dppx),(resolution:2dppx),(resolution:3dppx)]:[height:calc-size(auto,round(up,size,1px))]" data-cap-unmeasured="true" data-perf-row="human" data-perf-row-from-tail="7" data-perf-row-streaming="false" style="display: flow-root; position: relative; clip-path: inset(0px); contain: paint;" data-rs-ahead=""><div role="article" tabindex="-1" class="rounded-lg focus-visible:shadow-focus focus-visible:outline-hidden" aria-setsize="30" aria-posinset="23" aria-label="Message 23 of 30"><div class="contents" data-mini-claude-message="_r_1hr_"><div data-transcript-row="" class="mt-6 [&amp;&gt;[data-turn-key]]:!my-0 [&amp;&gt;[data-reply-scope]&gt;[data-turn-key]]:!my-0 [&amp;:has(&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]:not(:empty)):has(&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]:not(:empty),&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]&gt;*)]:pb-md [&amp;:has(&gt;[data-reply-scope]&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]:not(:empty)):has(&gt;[data-reply-scope]&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]:not(:empty),&gt;[data-reply-scope]&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]&gt;*)]:pb-md"><h3 data-find-omitted="" class="sr-only select-none">You said: how to add python code in phase4 step 2</h3><div data-user-scope="" class="group group/message-row min-w-0"><div data-cds="UserMessage" class="group/message-row flex w-full min-w-0