text-[length:var(--msg-code-block-size,0.875rem)] !leading-relaxed p-3.5" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono);"><code class="language-python" data-highlight="final" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono); white-space: pre;"><span class="block [unicode-bidi:inherit] [text-align:-webkit-match-parent] [text-align:match-parent]" data-code-line-group=""><span><span><span style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">import</span> sys
</span><span><span style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">import</span> duckdb
</span><span>
</span><span>order_id = sys<span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">.</span>argv<span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">[</span><span style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">1</span><span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">]</span>
</span><span>con = duckdb<span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">.</span>connect<span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">(</span><span style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">"olist/olist.duckdb"</span><span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">,</span><span style="color: rgb(247, 171, 95);"> read_only</span>=<span style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">True</span><span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">)</span>
</span><span>
</span><span>rows = con<span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">.</span>execute<span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">(</span>
</span><span><span style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">    "select order_id, order_status, purchased_at from main.fct_orders where order_id = ?"</span><span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">,</span>
</span><span><span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">    [</span>order_id<span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">],</span>
</span><span><span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">).</span>fetchall<span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">()</span>
</span><span><span style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">print</span><span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">(</span>rows<span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">)</span>
</span><span>con<span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">.</span>close<span style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">()</span></span></span></span></code></pre></div></div></div>
<p dir="ltr">If <code dir="ltr">main.fct_orders</code> isn’t found, dbt created the table in another schema. To find it, run <code dir="ltr">python -c "import duckdb; print(duckdb.connect('olist/olist.duckdb').execute('show all tables').df())"</code>.</p>
<h3 dir="ltr" aria-level="5">Step C: Prove the incremental run works</h3>
<div data-not-prose=""><div role="group" aria-label="powershell code" tabindex="0" dir="ltr" class="relative group/copy bg-bg-000/50 border-0.5 border-border-400 rounded-[var(--msg-block-radius,0.5rem)] focus-visible:outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent-100"><div class="static opacity-0 transition-[position] transition-discrete duration-0 delay-300 group-hover/copy:sticky group-hover/copy:opacity-100 group-hover/copy:delay-0 group-focus-within/copy:sticky group-focus-within/copy:opacity-100 group-focus-within/copy:delay-0 pointer-coarse:sticky pointer-coarse:opacity-100 [@media(hover:none)]:sticky [@media(max-resolution:1.99dppx)]:sticky [@media(hover:none)]:opacity-100 top-2 py-2 h-12 w-0 float-right"><div class="absolute right-0 h-8 px-2 items-center inline-flex z-10"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 rounded-[calc(var(--cds-radius)+var(--cds-button-radius-add,0px))] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-text-button-icon-disabled)] group-hover/copy:backdrop-blur-md group-focus-within/copy:backdrop-blur-md pointer-coarse:backdrop-blur-md [@media(hover:none)]:backdrop-blur-md" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" data-testid="code-block-copy" id="_r_309_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow] stacks:transition-[box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer  "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1)); font-weight: 433.3;"></span></span></button><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span></div></div><div class="text-secondary text-caption-regular font-sans p-3.5 pb-0 print:break-after-avoid" data-find-omitted="">powershell</div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><pre class="code-block__code !my-0 !rounded-[var(--msg-block-radius,0.5rem)] !text-[length:var(--msg-code-block-size,0.875rem)] !leading-relaxed p-3.5" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono);"><code class="language-powershell" data-highlight="final" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono); white-space: pre;"><span class="block [unicode-bidi:inherit] [text-align:-webkit-match-parent] [text-align:match-parent]" data-code-line-group=""><span><span><span style="color: rgb(129, 136, 152);"># 1. Check BEFORE: shows the old status</span>
</span><span>python check_order.py PASTE_ORDER_ID_HERE
</span><span>
</span><span><span style="color: rgb(129, 136, 152);"># 2. Rebuild only the fact table (run from inside the olist folder)</span>
</span><span>cd olist
</span><span>dbt run --select fct_orders
</span><span>cd ..
</span><span>
</span><span><span style="color: rgb(129, 136, 152);"># 3. Check AFTER: should show the new status</span>
</span><span>python check_order.py PASTE_ORDER_ID_HERE</span></span></span></code></pre></div></div></div>
<p dir="ltr">Take a screenshot of the before and after output, along with the <code dir="ltr">dbt run</code> log. In the log, look for the incremental model line. This is your proof for the README that only changed rows were reprocessed, without a full rebuild.</p>
<h3 dir="ltr" aria-level="5">Why this works</h3>
<ul dir="ltr">
<li><code dir="ltr">stg_orders</code> is a view, so it reads the changed raw row immediately.</li>
<li>The incremental filter only looks at orders from the last 30 days before the newest purchase date. The most recent order is inside that window, so it gets reprocessed.</li>
<li><code dir="ltr">unique_key='order_id'</code> replaces the old fact row with the new one.</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="ltr" aria-level="5">If it doesn’t work</h3>
<ul dir="ltr">
<li><strong>“Could not set lock on file”:</strong> close whatever else has <code dir="ltr">olist.duckdb</code> open.</li>
<li><strong>Status didn’t change after the dbt run:</strong> make sure you ran <code dir="ltr">dbt run --select fct_orders</code> and not a full-refresh. Also check the incremental <code dir="ltr">where</code> clause in <code dir="ltr">fct_orders.sql</code> is inside <code dir="ltr">{% if is_incremental() %}</code>.</li>
<li><strong>“No such file” for the script:</strong> you’re in the wrong folder. Run <code dir="ltr">dir</code> and check you can see <code dir="ltr">update_order.py</code> and <code dir="ltr">load_raw.py</code>.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="ltr">The same pattern works for the seller snapshot demo later: create a similar script that updates <code dir="ltr">seller_city</code> for one seller in <code dir="ltr">raw.sellers</code>, then run <code dir="ltr">dbt snapshot</code> before and after.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="ms-[calc(var(--cds-assistant-message-text-inset,0px)_-_6px)] touch:has-[&gt;[data-size=xs]&gt;:first-child:not(time)]:ms-[calc(var(--cds-assistant-message-text-inset,0px)_-_0.625rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] print:mt-xs"><div data-testid="message-actions" data-cds="MessageActions" data-deferred="" data-size="xs" class="flex items-center select-none"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-control w-px"></span><button type="button" class="sr-only" aria-label="Show message actions for Claude responded: Adding the Python code for Phase 4, step 2"></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rs-index="24" data-index="24" data-testid="transcript-row" class="relative [@media(resolution:1dppx),(resolution:2dppx),(resolution:3dppx)]:[height:calc-size(auto,round(up,size,1px))]" data-cap-unmeasured="true" data-perf-row="human" data-perf-row-from-tail="5" data-perf-row-streaming="false" style="display: flow-root; position: relative; clip-path: inset(0px); contain: paint;" data-rs-ahead=""><div role="article" tabindex="-1" class="rounded-lg focus-visible:shadow-focus focus-visible:outline-hidden" aria-setsize="30" aria-posinset="25" aria-label="Message 25 of 30"><div class="contents" data-mini-claude-message="_r_1hr_"><div data-transcript-row="" class="mt-6 [&amp;&gt;[data-turn-key]]:!my-0 [&amp;&gt;[data-reply-scope]&gt;[data-turn-key]]:!my-0 [&amp;:has(&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]:not(:empty)):has(&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]:not(:empty),&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]&gt;*)]:pb-md [&amp;:has(&gt;[data-reply-scope]&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]:not(:empty)):has(&gt;[data-reply-scope]&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]:not(:empty),&gt;[data-reply-scope]&gt;[data-re