ir="ltr" class="cds-inline-code whitespace-pre-wrap">st.dataframe</code>. Run with <code dir="ltr" class="cds-inline-code whitespace-pre-wrap">streamlit run app.py</code>.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-testid="user-message-actions" data-cds="MessageActions" data-deferred="" data-size="xs" class="flex items-center select-none"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-control w-px"></span><button type="button" class="sr-only" aria-label="Show message actions for You said: how to do this Optional Streamlit: pip install streamlit, then a small app.py that opens duckdb.connect(&quot;olist/olist.duckdb&quot;, read_only=True), runs each query …"></button></div></div></div><span role="status" class="sr-only" data-find-omitted="" data-testid="failed-send-status-region" data-shows-under-app-frame=""></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rs-index="25" data-index="25" data-testid="transcript-row" class="relative [@media(resolution:1dppx),(resolution:2dppx),(resolution:3dppx)]:[height:calc-size(auto,round(up,size,1px))]" data-perf-row="assistant" data-perf-row-from-tail="4" data-perf-row-streaming="false" style="display: flow-root; position: relative; clip-path: inset(0px); contain: paint;" data-rs-ahead=""><div role="article" tabindex="-1" class="rounded-lg focus-visible:shadow-focus focus-visible:outline-hidden" aria-setsize="30" aria-posinset="26" aria-label="Message 26 of 30"><div class="contents" data-mini-claude-message="_r_1hr_"><div data-transcript-row="" class="mt-xs [&amp;&gt;[data-turn-key]]:!my-0 [&amp;&gt;[data-reply-scope]&gt;[data-turn-key]]:!my-0 [&amp;:has(&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]:not(:empty)):has(&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]:not(:empty),&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]&gt;*)]:pb-md [&amp;:has(&gt;[data-reply-scope]&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]:not(:empty)):has(&gt;[data-reply-scope]&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]:not(:empty),&gt;[data-reply-scope]&gt;[data-reserves-actions-gap]&gt;*)]:pb-md"><div data-reply-scope="" class="group group/messag