--font-claude-response, var(--cds-font-voice)); --_prose-font-heading-display: var(--_prose-font-heading);"><div data-perf-reply-text="" class="_blocks_ta2es_47 standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 whitespace-normal break-words print:block"><h2 dir="ltr" aria-level="4">Build the Streamlit dashboard</h2>
<p dir="ltr">Streamlit turns a Python script into a web page. Your three queries become three sections on it.</p>
<h3 dir="ltr" aria-level="5">Step 1: Install it</h3>
<p dir="ltr">With your virtual environment active (the prompt starts with <code dir="ltr">(.venv)</code>), run from the repo root:</p>
