<p dir="ltr">In Databricks, export each notebook with <strong>File → Export → Source file</strong>. Download your pipeline files the same way, or copy and paste their contents into new files on your laptop.</p>
<h4 dir="ltr" aria-level="6"><code dir="ltr">README.md</code></h4>
