<h3 dir="ltr" aria-level="5">Before you commit it</h3>
<ul dir="ltr">
<li><strong>Make the labels match what you built.</strong> If your CI only runs <code dir="ltr">dbt parse</code>, change the CI label to say so. If you skipped the snapshot, <code dir="ltr">dim_date</code>, or the dashboard, delete those nodes. A diagram that doesn’t match the repo looks worse than a simple one.</li>
<li><strong>Preview it first.</strong> Paste the code into mermaid.live to check it renders. VS Code also previews it if you have a Mermaid extension installed.</li>
<li><strong>If it’s too wide or the text is tiny</strong> on GitHub, change <code dir="ltr">flowchart LR</code> to <code dir="ltr">flowchart TB</code> on the first line, which stacks it top to bottom.</li>
<li><strong>If you get a syntax error,</strong> the usual causes are a missing closing quote, or a node ID reused with different text. Keep node IDs (like <code dir="ltr">STG</code>) short, with no spaces.</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="ltr" aria-level="5">Optional: save it as an image</h3>
<p dir="ltr">On mermaid.live, use the <strong>Actions</strong> menu to download a PNG or SVG. Save it to <code dir="ltr">docs/images/architecture.png</code> and add <code dir="ltr">![Architecture](docs/images/architecture.png)</code> under the Mermaid block. That gives you a backup if someone views the repo somewhere that doesn’t render Mermaid.</p>
<p dir="ltr">I can make a matching diagram for the Databricks repo or adjust this one if your final models differ. Just tell me what changed.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ms-[calc(var(--cds-assistant-message-text-inset,0px)_-_6px)] touch:has-[&gt;[data-size=xs]&gt;:first-child:not(time)]:ms-[calc(var(--cds-assistant-message-text-inset,0px)_-_0.625rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] print:mt-xs"><div data-cds="MessageActions" data-reveal="fade" data-always-visible="" role="toolbar" aria-label="Message actions" data-size="xs" tabindex="-1" class="flex items-center select-none touch:flex-wrap touch:[--cds-h-control--xs:calc(2rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] touch:h-auto touch:min-h-[calc(1.5rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] touch:gap-y-[calc(0.5rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] touch:*:-my-[calc(0.25rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] [&amp;_button]:text-muted [&amp;_button:hover:not([aria-pressed=true])]:text-primary stacks:[&amp;_button:not(:where([data-cds-theme]_*:not([data-cds-unthemed]_*)))]:[--cds-text-muted:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-plain-secondary)]!" data-testid="message-actions"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 rounded-[calc(var(--cds-radius)+var(--cds-button-radius-add,0px))] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-bu